   "text": "Trade-offs to raise\n\u2022 P0 excessive agency: district-admin service account\n\u2022 P0 safety disclosures need a human\n\u2022 P1 custody flags, opt-outs, rate limits\n\u2022 P1 no training on minors without DPA\n\u2022 Kill switch per district\n\u2022 Model output never sends on its own",
   "originalText": "Trade-offs to raise\n\u2022 P0 excessive agency: district-admin service account\n\u2022 P0 safety disclosures need a human\n\u2022 P1 custody flags, opt-outs, rate limits\n\u2022 P1 no training on minors without DPA\n\u2022 Kill switch per district\n\u2022 Model output never sends on its own",
